# 2. Post-attention RMSNorm

Input:

```text
attention_residual
```

Apply the actual Layer 0 post-attention RMSNorm using:

```text
epsilon = actual GGUF/model configuration value
```

Do not hard-code epsilon if it can be read from model metadata.

The operation is conceptually:

```text
mean_square = sum(x_i²) / hidden_size

inv_rms = 1 / sqrt(mean_square + epsilon)

normalized_i = x_i * inv_rms

output_i = normalized_i * weight_i
```

Use the existing verified RMSNorm implementation if applicable.

Do not create a second subtly different implementation without reason.

